        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 44,
        "verse": 3
      },
      {
        "text": "Thou art my King, O God: command deliverances for Jacob.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 12,
            "end": 16,
            "text": "Ps. 74:12; 2 Ne. 10:14; Alma 5:50; D&C 38:21 (21–22)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 4,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 44:4",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 44,
        "verse": 4
      },
      {
        "text": "Through thee will we push down our enemies: through thy name will we tread them under that rise up against us.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 5,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 44:5",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 44,
        "verse": 5
      },
      {
        "text": "For I will not trust in my bow, neither shall my sword save me.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 15,
            "end": 20,
            "text": "Ps. 33:16 (16–18); 2 Ne. 4:34; 28:31; D&C 1:19 (19–20)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 6,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 44:6",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 44,
        "verse": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "But thou hast saved us from our enemies, and hast put them to shame that hated us.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 7,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 44:7",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 44,
        "verse": 7
      },
      {
        "text": "In God we boast all the day long, and praise thy name for ever. Selah.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 10,
            "end": 15,
            "text": "2 Ne. 33:6; Alma 26:16 (10–16); D&C 76:61."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 8,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 44:8",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 44,
        "verse": 8
      },
      {
        "text": "But thou hast cast off, and put us to shame; and goest not forth with our armies.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 9,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 44:9",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 44,
        "verse": 9
      },
      {
        "text": "Thou makest us to turn back from the enemy: and they which hate us spoil for themselves.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 10,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 44:10",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 44,
        "verse": 10
      },
      {
        "text": "Thou hast given us like sheep appointed for meat; and hast scattered us among the heathen.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 59,
            "end": 68,
            "text": "TG Israel, Scattering of."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 30,
            "end": 39
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 11,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
