      {
        "text": "Thou makest us a byword among the heathen, a shaking of the head among the people.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 14,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 44:14",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 44,
        "verse": 14
      },
      {
        "text": "My confusion is continually before me, and the shame of my face hath covered me,",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 13,
            "end": 15
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 15,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 44:15",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 44,
        "verse": 15
      },
      {
        "text": "For the voice of him that reproacheth and blasphemeth; by reason of the enemy and avenger.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 16,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 44:16",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 44,
        "verse": 16
      },
      {
        "text": "All this is come upon us; yet have we not forgotten thee, neither have we dealt falsely in thy covenant.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 17,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 44:17",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 44,
        "verse": 17
      },
      {
        "text": "Our heart is not turned back, neither have our steps declined from thy way;",
